@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ExportCommand" as Export LOGIC_COLOR
participant "model:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "roster:ReadOnlyAddressBook" as Book MODEL_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nCsvUtil" as Csv #A9A9A9
participant "<<class>>\nFiles / FileUtil" as Files STORAGE_COLOR

note over Logic, Export
AddressBookParser and ExportCommandParser have parsed
export file/exports/staff.csv into a validated relative CSV path.
HistoryAction.NONE: no checkpoint, history commit or employee-file save.
end note
Logic -> Export : execute(model)
activate Export
Export -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Export : complete roster
Export -> Book : getEmployeeList()
Book --> Export : stored employee list
Export -> Export : resolveFilePath()
note right of Export
Stored order, including archived and hidden employees.
Reject locations outside the app folder after following links.
end note
loop each employee
    Export -> Csv : toCsvLine(eight field values)
    Csv --> Export : quoted CSV record
end
Export -> Files : createDirectories(parentFolder)
Export -> Files : writeToFile(path, header and records)
alt write succeeds
    Files --> Export
    Export --> Logic : CommandResult("Exported <count> employee(s) to <path>")
else IOException
    Files --> Export : exception
    Export --> Logic : CommandException(export-specific write error)
end
deactivate Export
note over Model, Files
Employee data, view and history are unchanged.
Output overwrites an existing CSV with an ordinary file write.
end note
@enduml
